<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1865459707"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:11.078"><div begin="13.710" end="54.537" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.710" end="21.749" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.710" end="14.887">空</span><span begin="14.887" end="15.249">气</span><span begin="15.249" end="16.088">里</span> <span begin="17.783" end="18.295">都</span><span begin="18.295" end="18.592">是</span><span begin="18.592" end="19.243">你</span><span begin="19.243" end="20.404">的痕迹</span><span begin="20.404" end="20.868">和</span><span begin="20.868" end="21.145">气</span><span begin="21.145" end="21.749">息</span></p><p begin="23.615" end="35.303" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.615" end="24.878">说</span><span begin="24.878" end="25.326">熟</span><span begin="25.326" end="26.153">悉</span> <span begin="27.703" end="28.194">有</span><span begin="28.194" end="28.585">些</span><span begin="28.585" end="29.090">勉</span><span begin="29.090" end="30.353">强和委</span><span begin="30.353" end="31.551">屈</span> <span begin="32.815" end="33.750">早</span><span begin="33.750" end="34.083">已</span><span begin="34.083" end="35.303">经</span></p><p begin="37.036" end="45.347" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.036" end="38.335">别</span><span begin="38.335" end="38.781">轻</span><span begin="38.781" end="39.784">易</span> <span begin="41.065" end="43.624">让泪流的过程</span><span begin="43.624" end="44.039">有</span><span begin="44.039" end="44.576">声</span><span begin="44.576" end="45.347">音</span></p><p begin="47.065" end="54.537" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.065" end="47.758">我</span><span begin="47.758" end="48.323">怕</span><span begin="48.323" end="48.917">我放</span><span begin="48.917" end="49.670">弃</span> <span begin="51.162" end="51.673">假</span><span begin="51.673" end="51.928">装</span><span begin="51.928" end="52.695">轻松</span><span begin="52.695" end="53.352">的</span><span begin="53.388" end="53.798">语</span><span begin="53.798" end="54.537">气</span></p></div><div begin="58.839" end="1:25.653" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="58.839" end="1:04.511" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.839" end="1:00.708">我弄丢了</span><span begin="1:00.708" end="1:01.996">你</span> <span begin="1:02.285" end="1:04.043">独自在原</span><span begin="1:04.043" end="1:04.511">地</span></p><p begin="1:05.715" end="1:11.507" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.715" end="1:07.375">我们的过</span><span begin="1:07.375" end="1:08.501">去</span> <span begin="1:09.000" end="1:10.732">已经回不</span><span begin="1:10.732" end="1:11.507">去</span></p><p begin="1:12.460" end="1:18.296" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.460" end="1:14.182">命运这道</span><span begin="1:14.182" end="1:15.190">题</span> <span begin="1:15.668" end="1:17.095">本就没</span><span begin="1:17.095" end="1:17.402">有</span><span begin="1:17.402" end="1:17.881">逻</span><span begin="1:17.881" end="1:18.296">辑</span></p><p begin="1:18.319" end="1:25.653" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:18.319" end="1:20.527">偏要找相爱</span><span begin="1:20.527" end="1:21.132">的证</span><span begin="1:21.132" end="1:21.631">据</span> <span begin="1:21.744" end="1:24.311">曾经都爱得太</span><span begin="1:24.311" end="1:24.978">用</span><span begin="1:24.978" end="1:25.653">力</span></p></div><div begin="1:26.112" end="1:56.807" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:26.112" end="1:32.122" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.112" end="1:27.946">我弄丢了</span><span begin="1:27.946" end="1:29.163">你</span> <span begin="1:29.514" end="1:31.274">怪我不小</span><span begin="1:31.274" end="1:32.122">心</span></p><p begin="1:32.969" end="1:38.951" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.969" end="1:34.706">你会在哪</span><span begin="1:34.706" end="1:35.834">里</span> <span begin="1:36.304" end="1:38.026">被别人拾</span><span begin="1:38.026" end="1:38.951">起</span></p><p begin="1:39.735" end="1:45.530" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.735" end="1:41.459">沿途的风</span><span begin="1:41.459" end="1:42.948">景</span> <span begin="1:43.183" end="1:44.381">路过已</span><span begin="1:44.381" end="1:44.686">是</span><span begin="1:44.686" end="1:45.112">万</span><span begin="1:45.112" end="1:45.530">幸</span></p><p begin="1:45.716" end="1:56.807" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.716" end="1:47.793">别让错过成</span><span begin="1:47.793" end="1:48.123">了</span><span begin="1:48.123" end="1:48.519">默</span><span begin="1:48.519" end="1:49.069">契</span> <span begin="1:49.147" end="1:51.685">成了我们最后</span><span begin="1:51.685" end="1:52.892">的</span><span begin="1:54.224" end="1:54.716">结</span><span begin="1:54.716" end="1:56.807">局</span></p></div><div begin="2:15.333" end="2:55.818" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:15.333" end="2:23.538" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:15.333" end="2:16.362">不</span><span begin="2:16.456" end="2:16.915">可</span><span begin="2:16.915" end="2:17.941">惜</span> <span begin="2:19.382" end="2:19.923">此</span><span begin="2:19.923" end="2:20.164">刻</span><span begin="2:20.164" end="2:20.913">还</span><span begin="2:20.913" end="2:22.568">能看清你</span><span begin="2:22.568" end="2:22.919">背</span><span begin="2:22.919" end="2:23.538">影</span></p><p begin="2:25.380" end="2:36.138" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.380" end="2:26.693">就</span><span begin="2:26.693" end="2:27.072">已</span><span begin="2:27.072" end="2:28.219">经</span> <span begin="2:29.409" end="2:30.958">感谢这场</span><span begin="2:30.958" end="2:32.014">雪</span><span begin="2:32.058" end="2:32.501">降</span><span begin="2:32.501" end="2:33.831">临</span> <span begin="2:34.462" end="2:34.933">暂</span><span begin="2:34.933" end="2:35.351">停</span><span begin="2:35.351" end="2:36.138">你</span></p><p begin="2:38.580" end="2:46.618" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:38.580" end="2:40.003">今</span><span begin="2:40.003" end="2:40.474">天</span><span begin="2:40.474" end="2:41.737">起</span> <span begin="2:42.723" end="2:45.296">就算听到别人</span><span begin="2:45.296" end="2:45.730">提</span><span begin="2:45.730" end="2:46.154">起</span><span begin="2:46.154" end="2:46.618">你</span></p><p begin="2:48.664" end="2:55.818" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.664" end="2:49.223">说</span><span begin="2:49.223" end="2:49.905">着</span><span begin="2:49.905" end="2:50.577">没关</span><span begin="2:50.577" end="2:51.297">系</span> <span begin="2:52.692" end="2:53.302">假</span><span begin="2:53.302" end="2:53.830">装自</span><span begin="2:53.830" end="2:54.374">己</span><span begin="2:54.622" end="2:55.259">不在</span><span begin="2:55.259" end="2:55.818">意</span></p></div><div begin="2:57.038" end="3:23.903" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:57.038" end="3:03.281" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:57.038" end="2:58.956">我弄丢了</span><span begin="2:58.956" end="3:00.195">你</span> <span begin="3:00.567" end="3:02.374">独自在原</span><span begin="3:02.374" end="3:03.281">地</span></p><p begin="3:03.917" end="3:09.709" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:03.917" end="3:05.662">我们的过</span><span begin="3:05.662" end="3:06.908">去</span> <span begin="3:07.365" end="3:09.061">已经回不</span><span begin="3:09.061" end="3:09.709">去</span></p><p begin="3:10.685" end="3:16.521" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:10.685" end="3:12.471">命运这道</span><span begin="3:12.471" end="3:13.979">题</span> <span begin="3:14.107" end="3:15.434">本就没</span><span begin="3:15.434" end="3:15.705">有</span><span begin="3:15.705" end="3:16.199">逻</span><span begin="3:16.199" end="3:16.521">辑</span></p><p begin="3:16.569" end="3:23.903" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:16.569" end="3:18.813">偏要找相爱</span><span begin="3:18.813" end="3:19.337">的证</span><span begin="3:19.337" end="3:19.881">据</span> <span begin="3:19.994" end="3:22.651">曾经都爱得太</span><span begin="3:22.651" end="3:23.398">用</span><span begin="3:23.398" end="3:23.903">力</span></p></div><di